{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars","id":1126951,"title":"Disney princesses as Solars","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-09T21:11:30-07:00","id":1126951,"title":"Disney princesses as Solars","content":"Maybe it's being a dad and all the kid movies/books, etc. but I've gotten this idea in my head of a circle of Solars based on Disney Princesses. <br /> <br /> You could have Merida the Dawn Caste. After taking her Second Breath on the archery field, she broke that weird bear curse on her mother (textbook thaumaturgy - the witch only knows one ritual!) and rode off on her Familiar steed Angus, perhaps finding Moonlit Huntress in a stream above a waterfall she climbed. Supernal Archery with good Athletics, Survival, throw in some Melee for the sword, maybe some Presence, Lore (legends are lessons after all), even Occult (what with the wisps and standing stones and all). <br /> <br /> Moana would be great as a Performance Supernal Zenith. Calming a raging volcano goddess with a song that reminds her who she really is? That's as Exalted as it gets! Ally merit for the powerful Lunar buddy, Command for the tribe of voyagers she leads. High Survival and Sail for the wayfinding, Integrity, maybe Brawl (with an specialty in improvised) for battle. <br /> <br /> This one's a bit of a stretch but... Belle as a Lore Supernal Twilight. Received her Exaltation in the library as she sought a way to undo the Wyld mutation her Lunar mate suffered. Bookishness of course lends itself to Sorcery and Craft -- she's always dealing with those animated clocks and candelabra and teapots, after all. <br /> <br /> Mulan as a Larceny Supernal Night Caste. This one is directly inspired by Ask the Devs posts about Flawlessly Impenetrable Disguise. After fooling an entire legion with her disguise and assassinating an enemy general, she's appointed spymaster to the emperor. High athletics, melee, archery, stealth. Familiar merit for the guardian dragon spirit. <br /> <br /> But who would be the Eclipse?!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11690-mizzlfoshizzl","name":"mizzlfoshizzl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11690_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T22:06:47-07:00","id":1126970,"title":"","content":"Ariel?<br /> <br /> She had a Deal with the Sea Witch, after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u00e4! I\u00e4! Moe fthagn!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","name":"Valles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar280_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"677"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T22:24:53-07:00","id":1126979,"title":"","content":"Matoaka Aka. Pocahontas, would make for a good eclipse. Her Supernal would likely be Presence, and she would have Exalted after preventing all out war between her tribe and the European settlers. by her actions in the film she shows that she already knows Bureaucracy (how to deal with an organization), Occult (she talks to a tree spirit named Grandmother Willow), Presence (her declaration of love as she puts herself between him and his executioner) and Socialize (convincing her father to turn from the path of hatred and choose his own path).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2080-protector152","name":"Protector152","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T22:29:28-07:00","id":1126984,"title":"","content":"Well, if we're looking at princess owned by Disney then I would say that Princess Leia is the best example of an Eclipse, what with her work as an ambassador, spy, bureaucrat, and all around leader. She has long been one of my &quot;go-to&quot; examples of Eclipse caste characters in popular culture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T05:37:36-07:00","id":1127067,"title":"","content":"i know you said as Solars, but Moana seems to be pretty clearly an exigent of the ocean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9124-satoshi","name":"satoshi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"282"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T06:16:23-07:00","id":1127081,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>satoshi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127067#post1127067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i know you said as Solars, but Moana seems to be pretty clearly an exigent of the ocean.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say she's more a Solar who just happens to have the ocean as a Mentor/Familiar. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (More seriously, &quot;the ocean&quot; doesn't have an Exigent because &quot;the ocean&quot; isn't a god, and while there are numerous sea-gods that could in theory be granted use of the divine fire, I don't see the resulting Exalt looking overmuch like Moana.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T09:22:41-07:00","id":1127166,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Protector152</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1126979#post1126979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Matoaka Aka. Pocahontas, would make for a good eclipse. Her Supernal would likely be Presence, and she would have Exalted after preventing all out war between her tribe and the European settlers. by her actions in the film she shows that she already knows Bureaucracy (how to deal with an organization), Occult (she talks to a tree spirit named Grandmother Willow), Presence (her declaration of love as she puts herself between him and his executioner) and Socialize (convincing her father to turn from the path of hatred and choose his own path).</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, this is headcanon now. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11690-mizzlfoshizzl","name":"mizzlfoshizzl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11690_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T09:31:13-07:00","id":1127170,"title":"","content":"I am currently playing Elsa as a Performance Supernal Zenith. As soon as we hit E3 I can get Elements-Sculpted Avatar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T10:33:32-07:00","id":1127192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127081#post1127081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd say she's more a Solar who just happens to have the ocean as a Mentor/Familiar. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (More seriously, &quot;the ocean&quot; doesn't have an Exigent because &quot;the ocean&quot; isn't a god, and while there are numerous sea-gods that could in theory be granted use of the divine fire, I don't see the resulting Exalt looking overmuch like Moana.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I've actually argued that Moana is a heroic mortal throughout most of the movie with a lunar mentor and a god of the sea/ powerful water elemental as an ally. I figure she'd likely exalt as a solar when she returns the heart though. <br /> <br /> As for how she gets so good at sailing over such a short time? Lunar mentor and training charms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T10:52:04-07:00","id":1127198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>armyofwhispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127192#post1127192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've actually argued that Moana is a heroic mortal throughout most of the movie with a lunar mentor and a god of the sea/ powerful water elemental as an ally. I figure she'd likely exalt as a solar when she returns the heart though.</div> </div> </div> </div>In my headcanon, it's the climactic moment when she holds The Heart aloft and Te Ka turns to see the beacon of light that is her Caste Mark and Bonfire Anima.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11690-mizzlfoshizzl","name":"mizzlfoshizzl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11690_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T12:32:54-07:00","id":1127243,"title":"","content":"Y'know, thinking about it I'd almost say that Moana would be the eclipse. Her big thing is sailing the world reconnecting everything. If you follow my headcanon of her having a spirit ally that fits the eclipse mold as well. Plus she always struck me as a sail supernal rather than performance. Admittedly the singing the song to the spirit was pretty epic, but to me that was more a situation of calming an angry spirit through an appeal to her better nature. <br /> <br /> As for who the Zenith would be then... maybe one of the early princesses with all their animal companions? None that I can think of really fit the priest or holy woman archetype though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T13:37:09-07:00","id":1127294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>armyofwhispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127243#post1127243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Y'know, thinking about it I'd almost say that Moana would be the eclipse. Her big thing is sailing the world reconnecting everything. If you follow my headcanon of her having a spirit ally that fits the eclipse mold as well. Plus she always struck me as a sail supernal rather than performance. Admittedly the singing the song to the spirit was pretty epic, but to me, that was more a situation of calming an angry spirit through an appeal to her better nature.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was my initial thought as well, but most of the Sail charms are focused on naval combat; whereas most of Moana's challenges are about finding her way around, withstanding the elements, and interacting with wildlife -- sounds a lot more like Survival to me. Her major character arc is mostly about becoming the leader she was always meant to be (as distinct from the one her father wanted her to be) which is just so Zenith. So then it was a coin toss between Performance and Presence for Supernal, but in the end, I thought Performance was more in her wheelhouse (both singing and oratory), although she would probably have a good amount of Charms from both.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11690-mizzlfoshizzl","name":"mizzlfoshizzl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11690_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T14:18:03-07:00","id":1127324,"title":"","content":"Vote [1]; Lilo for eclipse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(10chars)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","name":"Elkovash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T14:39:34-07:00","id":1127337,"title":"","content":"Y'know, while I was watching Moana I really thought, &quot;crap, this is practically <i>Exalted: the Movie</i>&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13651-roswynn","name":"Roswynn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13651_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T15:32:04-07:00","id":1127368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>armyofwhispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127243#post1127243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Y'know, thinking about it I'd almost say that Moana would be the eclipse. Her big thing is sailing the world reconnecting everything. If you follow my headcanon of her having a spirit ally that fits the eclipse mold as well. Plus she always struck me as a sail supernal rather than performance. Admittedly the singing the song to the spirit was pretty epic, but to me that was more a situation of calming an angry spirit through an appeal to her better nature.<br /> <br /> As for who the Zenith would be then... maybe one of the early princesses with all their animal companions? None that I can think of really fit the priest or holy woman archetype though.</div> </div> </div> </div>You could play up the purity of Snow White, that she was so lovely and spotless that she was holy. Performance, Survival (she probably roughed it in the woods a while before shacking up with seven mountainfolk, plus she has an army of forest animals that she could make scary with familiar charms.), integrity, presence.. all of it fits her nicely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T17:49:15-07:00","id":1127415,"title":"","content":"This is an awesome thread. Thank you OP!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11847-kfinigan","name":"KFinigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T18:30:17-07:00","id":1127419,"title":"","content":"Fro Zenith, perhaps Jasmine. Zeniths are leaders, and unlike most of the Princesses, she was for most of her life Sultan Hamid's only child, so I'd be astonished if she hadn't been trained in politics, statesmanship, and the others skills required of a ruler. In the series, she shows at least some talent for this, as witness the episode in which she dethrones Abis Mal, seizes control of his band, and only spares his life because it's a US-produced kid's show. Seriously, that was the only reason Abis retained his head in that episode.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T18:40:20-07:00","id":1127426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127419#post1127419\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fro Zenith, perhaps Jasmine. Zeniths are leaders, and unlike most of the Princesses, she was for most of her life Sultan Hamid's only child, so I'd be astonished if she hadn't been trained in politics, statesmanship, and the others skills required of a ruler.</div> </div> </div> </div>At the same time, during the apple scene in the first movie, she seemed equally surprised by the notion that people have to pay for things, and that people who take things without paying for them are subject to immediate limb-amputation.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying you <i>have</i> to know these little details to lead, but if she was indeed educated about running Agrabah, her teachers were outright negligent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 08-10-2017, 09:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T18:46:40-07:00","id":1127433,"title":"","content":"Man, this post got me thinking. Everyone laughed at Full Moon Judy Hops, but then, she showed them they were wrong!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T19:46:40-07:00","id":1127455,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127426#post1127426\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At the same time, during the apple scene in the first movie, she seemed equally surprised by the notion that people have to pay for things, and that people who take things without paying for them are subject to immediate limb-amputation.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that scene was more a case of her not connecting abstract teaching and concrete actuality. By her own statement, she'd not been beyond the palace walls before, and you'll note that she never again, in movies or series, makes any similar mistake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T20:38:56-07:00","id":1127465,"title":"","content":"i really enjoyed playing zenith disney princess. Survival and perform like whoa. You know singing songs and befriending all the wood land creatures. I think I gave her something lame like trying to end slavery but if I had to go back and do that game over her epic motivation would have been to help everyone find their one true love. That game was fantastic I remember using song to convince the varang city states and the local dbs to give up the slave trade. In my defense husband seducing demon dance is one hell of dru--- i mean charm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8897-joshopotamus","name":"joshopotamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T21:32:03-07:00","id":1127476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>joshopotamus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127465#post1127465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">if I had to go back and do that game over her epic motivation would have been to help everyone find their one true love.</div> </div> </div> </div>Leaving polyamorous people in quite an awkward position, I suppose?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T23:44:38-07:00","id":1127508,"title":"","content":"I say Jasmine is an Eclipse who Exalted when she agree to be shown the world on a Magic Carpet. She wants to travel, and is a born diplomat even without a desire to be. She has a Tiger Familiar and is friends with an emancipated Deva of Cecylene. She is set to marry a Night Caste Prince of Thieves, and is minimally interested in the downtrodden.<br /> <br /> <br /> And the most obvious one in my Opinion is Megara a Moonshadow Caste in the Service to a Lord of Death to seduce a gullible almighty Dawn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T06:38:00-07:00","id":1127595,"title":"","content":"Hmm, it's probably against the spirit of a thread titled &quot;Disney Princesses as Solars&quot; to bring in discussion of which ones should be mortals...<br /> <br /> (Jasmine would definitely be a mortal)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T06:50:28-07:00","id":1127600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127508#post1127508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I say Jasmine is an Eclipse who Exalted when she agree to be shown the world on a Magic Carpet. She wants to travel, and is a born diplomat even without a desire to be. She has a Tiger Familiar and is friends with an emancipated Deva of Cecylene. She is set to marry a Night Caste Prince of Thieves, and is minimally interested in the downtrodden.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can see that. I simply looked through the list of official Disney princesses and asked &quot;Which of these best fits at lesat one primary aspect of the Zenith Caste?&quot; and settled on Jasmine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T07:26:39-07:00","id":1127619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127455#post1127455\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that scene was more a case of her not connecting abstract teaching and concrete actuality.</div> </div> </div> </div>This feels like reaching. <br /> <br /> If the Sultan was so intent on those who rule Agrabah actually being able to manage things, his scenes in the movie surely would have reflected that, yes? Instead, he's pretty clearly foisted off all the work on Jafar while he plays with toys, feeds a macaw crackers from his (pocketless!) pants, permits hundreds of people to march on his palace and force the doors to admit a foreign head of state, and refuses to let his daughter out to experience the kingdom she's supposed to rule someday.<br /> <br /> Heck, the biggest thing he does with his executive power in the first movie is change one law for purely nepotistic reasons.<br /> <br /> I'll admit, I can't speak for the animated series, which I only remember vaguely (except that Mozenrath was awesome).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 08-12-2017, 03:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T08:44:24-07:00","id":1127663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127508#post1127508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I say Jasmine is an Eclipse who Exalted when she <b>agree to be shown the world on a Magic Carpet.</b> She wants to travel, and is a born diplomat even without a desire to be. She has a Tiger Familiar and is friends with an emancipated Deva of Cecylene. She is set to marry a Night Caste Prince of Thieves, and is minimally interested in the downtrodden.</div> </div> </div> </div>This... is not an exaltation story I would ever use. To me it really lacks agency on her part. Maybe when she sneaks out of the palace to see more of the world on her own?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T09:12:25-07:00","id":1127678,"title":"","content":"Jasmine is one of those Disney Princesses who is certainly compelling, but still not without her issues. She's given the trappings of agency, but very little in the way of actual capability or accomplishments. She's right in that she's not a prize to be won, but the story ultimately reflects this in terms of her having the power to select who gets to win her; this gets to be flexed a bit in her trying to tease out some honesty from somebody she's actually interested in, and distracting an antagonist with a show of reciprocating his lusts, but is otherwise fairly minimal.<br /> <br /> \u200bIf I was going to transplant the scenario into a game and do more than just a complete revision, I would have a mind to giving her a bit more agency in terms of the greater significance of any husband whom she might select, but that wouldn't have her as Exalted, but a mortal with great narrative significance based on a position of political importance.<br /> <br /> \u200bThat wouldn't necessarily mean subverting the narrative of marriage for love rather than duty, as something could still arise from development of a relationship based on personalities, but I would have a mind towards giving it some troubling consequences.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T13:04:39-07:00","id":1127748,"title":"","content":"Lilo is a good fit, I think, for Zenith. She's all about Integrity and Brawl and Presence, and the thing where you take a creature of Darkness and redeem it by teaching it about Love and Family is solid Zenith material-an Eclipse would have tricked or enslaved Stitch, not taught him to dance.<br /> <br /> I'd call Mulan a solid Night with War favored.<br /> <br /> Merida I'd probably run as a Lunar, honestly. Her story is about rebellion against the status quo and choosing her own freedom over the demands of her station, and about the difference between a monster and a man-even if she's not the one shapechanging, the story is about the anchors of love and family keeping her from turning into a monster like the cursed prince who serves as the villain of the piece. Plus, post-movie, she's totally gonna end up an unstoppable barbarian warlord leading a screaming horde of bear-skin clad berserkers, you just know it.<br /> <br /> Elsa is an interesting case. She's much more X Men and less Greek hero. I suppose you could call her an Air Aspect, especially as they're going to be stronger in 3e...but I think she's actually a good fit for a Defiler in 2e. She's a budding sorceress who hides her talents from her suspicious subjects, and after a major failure she gets a huge power boost, abandons her fetters, and goes off to build a giant fuckoff ice forts guarded by ice demons and terrorize the countryside with eternal winter entirely by accident. I mean, Twilights can do all that, but she's not a scholar-she's a rightful queen denied her rightful dominion. Her redemption by her love for her super-strength Lunar Mate sister is a nice arc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T14:55:08-07:00","id":1127789,"title":"","content":"Alas, Lilo isn't an official Disney Princess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T16:15:05-07:00","id":1127813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127789#post1127789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alas, Lilo isn't an official Disney Princess.</div> </div> </div> </div>Slander! Immaculate Propaganda!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T17:00:33-07:00","id":1127833,"title":"","content":"so is Megera a redeemed Abyssal?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T04:44:28-07:00","id":1128006,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>armyofwhispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127663#post1127663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This... is not an exaltation story I would ever use. To me it really lacks agency on her part. Maybe when she sneaks out of the palace to see more of the world on her own?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Exaltation isn't always about performing an action, it is often an Awakening. Arianna Exalted while napping, and Panther Exalted after depressed from a drug orgy. Jasmine was awakened to the wonders of the world beyond her life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T18:21:44-07:00","id":1128282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127833#post1127833\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so is Megera a redeemed Abyssal?</div> </div> </div> </div>Based on what we know about 3rd edition; probably a Liminal by the end :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(10chars)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","name":"Elkovash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T19:05:50-07:00","id":1128295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1128006#post1128006\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Exaltation isn't always about performing an action, it is often an Awakening. Arianna Exalted while napping, and Panther Exalted after depressed from a drug orgy. Jasmine was awakened to the wonders of the world beyond her life.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI take your point, but even within the framing of its own story, it still basically functions as a gift given to her by Aladdin in the course of courtship. Even with Arianna and Panther, those are cases of somebody trying to achieve something and a moment of catharsis while experiencing an existential crisis respectively; they still have a focus on character agency.<br /> <br /> \u200bWhen you get down to it, Jasmine just wants to leave the palace because she's never been allowed to before, and the ultimate fulfilment that carries for her comes from somebody else coming along and offering a means of regular vacation. Sure she <i>says</i> something about wanting to live her own life when she tries sneaking out, but she doesn't really do anything with it, seems to not really be well-equipped for any other life, and kind of returns to and stays in the palace fairly quickly. In the end, the regal life doesn't seem to be as much of an issue when she gets to be with this one guy she likes and she can regularly visit exotic locales.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T19:48:42-07:00","id":1128312,"title":"","content":"No mention of Kiida, Princess of Atlantis?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T17:17:49-07:00","id":1128630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127619#post1127619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This feels like reaching.<br /> <br /> If the Sultan was so intent on those who rule Agrabah actually being able to manage things, his scenes in the movie surely would have reflected that, yes? Instead, he's pretty clearly foisted off all the work on Jafar while he plays with toys, feeds a macaw crackers from his (pocketless!) pants, permits hundreds of people to march on his palace and force the doors to admit a foreign head of state, and refuses to let his daughter out to experience the kingdom she's supposed to rule someday.<br /> <br /> Heck, the biggest thing he does with his executive power in the first movie is change one law for purely nepotistic reasons.<br /> <br /> I'll admit, I can't speak for the animated series, which I only remember vaguely (except that Mozenrath was awesome).</div> </div> </div> </div>So.... the Sultan is Regent Fokuf. Heh... that's an amusing, if gross, image there.<br /> <br /> Well, by the logic of Jasmine's story from the movie, maybe a dragon blood rather than mortal or solar? She doesn't seem to change the world any, but also isn't just a plain human. As a DB, shed have a good reason to be confused about the plights of a commoner, she'd have a reason why she even in part buys into the marriage for duty rather than love (gotta keep the Breeding pure). Sure, she doesn't have obviously elemental charms like Elsa, but the story of her royal marriage issues would sound like a good story. Good thing Sultan Fokuf was saved by that night caste, or he'd be disappointed Jasmine was not only NOT marrying in the Blood, but also picked an anathema.<br /> <br /> I'd agree with Elsa being an Air Aspect. Perhaps she's from one of the few kingdoms not controlled by the Realm, a people who'd find the spontaneous Exaltation of a lost egg in their royal family as suspicious and frightening. They'd begin to worry the royal family is just a Dynasty in hiding, and Elsa's elemental power and inborn sorcery (initiated by a curse from that shard of devil-mirror in her eye) would be treated the way Anathema are treated in Satrapies. Luckily, those Trolls (fae? mountainfolk?) came along. Kristof as a Survival Solar or Lunar, Anna as... hm, maybe a Zenith or Eclipse.. I do like the idea of Arendelle finding dragon-blooded as ''anathema'' would make for a unique setting and total twist to the standard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T17:38:51-07:00","id":1128639,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1127081#post1127081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd say she's more a Solar who just happens to have the ocean as a Mentor/Familiar. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (More seriously, &quot;the ocean&quot; doesn't have an Exigent because &quot;the ocean&quot; isn't a god, and while there are numerous sea-gods that could in theory be granted use of the divine fire, I don't see the resulting Exalt looking overmuch like Moana.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Moana is a GREAT example of an Eclipse and their tales. Her biggest feats are communication, travel, trickery, and so on.<br /> Yeah Maui is her Lunar Mate but he's waiting until she fills in and gets enough of life as a mortal before anything. Though of course you run into the whole &quot;lunar needs other limitations to shapeshift&quot; (not JUST the fishhook AND needing practice but he's according to the extra manual stuff limited to the trophies on his necklace in terms of forms. I can hear <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar636_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"636\" data-vbnamecard=\"636\">Sunder the Gold</a> cringing at the nerf bat already)<br /> Beast is not a Lunar. He's a human who was Wyld mutated by a travelling fairy (no need to change much here) with a special terms to undo the fantasy/spell. She has not met her Lunar mate yet who WILL have a totem/appearance akin to the Beast's form. I was half tempted to make the Enchantress the new though Exalted longer ago incarnation of her Lunar Mate. (she turned the prince into that on a whim mostly it was something she 'knew' Maybe another way of form acquisition for Lunars to avoid kiling they &quot;trade&quot; she becomes a regal young beauty and he becomes a hideous monster)<br /> <br /> Snow White is a Zenith. She Exalts around the time she is spared by the Huntsman. She's young and a little unsure in her abilities. Dwarves are just dwarves, short miner forest dwelling craftsmen who's parents got so many thanks to some wyld infused Thaumaturgy. They are named after each day of the week born AND their trait (Grumpy Wednesday, Happy Sunday, Doc etc) as a side affect of this fertility spell the mother died giving birth to the last (I think that's Dopey canonically, right?) this broke the father and so on<br /> <br /> Princess Aurora/Briar Rose is mostly a victim of a local fairfolk or god (or a fair folk acting as a god, remember when we had those) who really was that offended at the snub.While interesting and more full of character and with the better tale I am afraid she doesn't cut it as an Exalted. Prince Phillip, her HUSBAND does though needed alot of fairy allies to help. As she doesn't have much in character but has tons of inherit/unearned blessings AND suffering . . . maybe a Dragonblooded? OR to be weird an Abyssal? Who somehow figures some trick to venting her Resonance?<br /> <br /> Cinderella is also not full Exalt Materal unless we go the Terrestrial Route. Well ONE way. Zenith. Mostly an integrity of spirit and her way with animals and nature.<br /> <br /> Ariel, a fish beastmen who traded with a witch for legs. was rescued by the local Water Aspect prince and her father, a half caste beastman offspring or godly offspring of some elementals. After enduring so much suffering and humiliation a Crab with a silver tongue convinces the father to grant her her fondish wish. This means her totem, btw, is man (or ape)<br /> <br /> Jasmine, Night Caste, with some of the standard DPrincess way with nature/animals and pet Tiger, hu-rah<br /> <br /> Tiana, is Eclipse and the modern incarnation of Admiral Sand, achieved when she married and redeemed her prince<br /> <br /> Rapunzel is mutant with some weird healing power for most of her debut. Could go Twilight<br /> <br /> Elsa is not human enough to Exalt. She's too powerful for a Dragonblooded and too elemental for any celestial Exalt.<br /> <br /> Nala<br /> Changing Moon, she's no slouch in the fighting department but she is more about stealth and social stuff as to just war-beast fullmoon.<br /> <br /> Alice; Eclipse Caste mastered the Dreaming charms and can logic a Fey to collapse their narratives.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","user":"Darmani","date":". 08-15-2017, 10:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","name":"Darmani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1498_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T17:43:37-07:00","id":1128643,"title":"","content":"Hmm, thinking about it... if one focused on her character beats rather than the precise scope and form of her power, sure, Elsa fits fairly well with a Dragon Blood in general and a Dynast in particular. That whole thing where you spend the early part of your life repressed and fearful and then it all explodes out in a moment of catharsis and wild abandon, accompanied by possibly dangerous elemental expressions, that's the basic life story of a Dynast and fits with a lot of Outcastes as well. You don't really have a straightforward equivalent in anybody to the part in which you grow up with an anxiety about your powers being a danger to yourself and others that needs to be held back at all costs... unless you had a story in which somebody was the child with the Dragon Blood who was raised by parents who would really rather prefer that she never Exalted, and had the impression that this could be done by preventing her from experiencing strong emotions.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cleverest of Things</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, by the logic of Jasmine's story from the movie, maybe a dragon blood rather than mortal or solar? She doesn't seem to change the world any, but also isn't just a plain human.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bHow is she not plain human?<br /> <br /> \u200bI feel kind of bad about diminishing the character, but her proactive actions in the story basically consist of telling a few people off (only a few listen) and distracting a guy by kissing him.<br /> <br /> \u200bOn the other hand, I really only just noticed that Jasmine is basically the sole female character in the film (not counting nameless ancillary characters who get about one line in a song, and crowd-scene extras), so perhaps a bit of diminishment is in order.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T17:52:52-07:00","id":1128645,"title":"","content":"Jasmine wants more but when she's back she WANTS to be queen. She's looking forward to it and demanding to be taken seriously STILL. She's Alladin's partner (well WILL be when he stops with the lying).<br /> And she expands nicely in the TV series. And even turns out to be not bad at diplomacy and courtly presentation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","name":"Darmani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1498_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T18:02:32-07:00","id":1128647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darmani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1126951-disney-princesses-as-solars?p=1128645#post1128645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jasmine wants more but when she's back she WANTS to be queen. She's looking forward to it and demanding to be taken seriously STILL.</div> </div> </div> </div>What specifically gives you that impression?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darmani</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">And she expands nicely in the TV series. And even turns out to be not bad at diplomacy and courtly presentation.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI suppose if we're discussing a character in general, it would be unfair to discount the tv series entirely. I'm sure I can't speak to the ratio of people who watched that to ones who saw the film, and I simply can't remember very much that happened in the show besides some of the villains and that one time they dealt with an evil sorcerer whose body rejected him and detached him from the neck up because his heart was nicer.<br /> <br /> \u200b.... Also just now a kind of omnipotent trickster character who was really kind of a proto-Discord. Huh.<br /> <br /> \u200bAnyway, I'm mostly just working through some considerations of the film (that I have certainly seen more frequently and more recently) that have previously gone unnoticed to me, and would at least make the point that giving a character more to do in a sequel does not necessarily affect their writing in an earlier, and stand-alone, story.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T09:26:18-07:00","id":1129265,"title":"","content":"Y'know I think that Rapunzel could make a great Eclipse. She snuck out of her tower to see the world, got a local guide, made deals to get guidance and to make sure her guide doesn't get arrested by Maximus, makes friends with ruffians, hell she walks into a dangerous place and not only does she not get molested or attacked she ends up with the entire group as her allies.<br /> <br /> I'd say her hair is an artifact that bonds to a host and can be used as an artifact whip. She likely has evocations that cover healing and she constantly uses the thing for athletics stunts.<br /> <br /> Probably Presence or Socialize for Supernal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":8804,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","user":"armyofwhispers","date":". 08-15-2017, 12:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-03T02:00:40-07:00","id":1136860,"title":"","content":"I know it's not exactly explosive, but could Jasmine's exaltation moment be the &quot;Unhand him, by order of the princess!&quot; moment? It's an affirmative action, taken to help others, and the guards immediately back away. With a bit more pyrotechnics, that feels like a suitable Zenith exaltation moment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":497,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","user":"Xerxes","date":". 09-03-2017, 05:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-03T04:04:27-07:00","id":1136878,"title":"","content":"On Rapunzel: She literally glows with golden sunlight when using her powers.<br /> <br /> Feel this needs pointing out.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'd say it's the story of... yeah, probably an Eclipse, she does have a lot of deal-making with others as kind of a go-to reaction IIRC. So specifically, her movie is the story of how she grows from being essentially a Sorcerer's exotic reagent into being a full-blown Solar. Essentially, you extend the story past the climax and it turns out she's unlocked her full starting character sheet, healing tears weren't a one-off.<br /> <br /> (Also, her moment of Exaltation is the scene in the tavern. Literally that second. She just steps up to the seemingly impossible challenge of impressing a room full of grizzled grim badasses... and gets them all to confess their deepest buried secret hopes, turning them into friends.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/234-superg","name":"SuperG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar234_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"451"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}